%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: JobReply2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _sameOptionTarget: 1
  _lines:
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: If I may put in my two cents, have you considered that the problem
      might not lie within your customers, but rather in you?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5765cb552eb0e743b1d025dd7e12a90, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Um, excuse me?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 632048a77c40f4449afafb4f2cd57c28, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Come on.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Is it so absurd to believe that, instead of your customerbase
      being so overwhelmingly underwhelming on their own, your judgments of these
      individuals are flawed?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I cannot BELIEVE you're trying to defend those guys right now.
      Did you not hear anything I said???
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I heard you loud and clear. And frankly, it seems to me that your
      incompatibility is a fault of yours, not theirs.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Even just talking to you, I can see why you might find others
      "boring."
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Simply because you are too defective to hold worthwhile conversation
      with that conversations tend not to come your way at all.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Hey, I thought you wanted to talk all "friendly??" What's with
      this crap?? Did you forget who owns this place????
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Do you not consider this friendly? As a friend, I am being honest
      with you and informing you that you are the problem. Is that not what friends
      do?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: NO!! You're supposed to tell me how awesome I am!!!! Not lecture
      at me about how I'm apparently so terrible that people don't want to talk to
      me!!!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I'm simply trying to tell you the truth, Jessi. The sooner you
      accept it, the better.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Though, I was under the impression it was something you already
      accepted? How come you're so reluctant to realize this conclusion?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Reluctant to accept what? That you're totally shittalking me right
      now??
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Because that's a pretty easy conclusion to make!!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Relax, Jessi. I think you're taking this the wrong way.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7221be3902993e49920b17cf290b8cb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "What I'm telling you right now is not a means of petty insult,
      but moreso just\u2026 opening your eyes to the truth."
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I can tell that you've struggled to accept it, but I'm here to
      help you with that.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Oh yeah?! How so??!! Are you gonna just keep running my name into
      the ground like everyone else??!!
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "So defensive\u2026 that might be a problem."
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Is it really worth it to see this through?
  _playerReplyOptions:
  - _choiceType: 1
    _optionText: Let it go
  - _choiceType: 2
    _optionText: Dig deeper
  _npcReplies:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3f88d542354559b4e9f3731f6bd1bf7c, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 674421e2d7eba4044a413e82bc492d72, type: 2}
  _gameEnd: 0
